<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on a basket of metals.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on a basket of metals.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International said it has issued 500,000 American-style call warrants, on a basket of metals including aluminium, copper, nickel and zinc.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    $100.0		    PREMIUM	8.65 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $8.65		     GEARING	11.56 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	28.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
